WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Stop it. I'm not interested in joining Zheng Guijun.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,300
But if you have any private work, the price is right

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,500
I can consider helping

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,900
After all, I also need to have some food.

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,300
Sit tight. The new owner will show you the house.

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,580
What neighborhood is this?

7
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,580
The owners rely entirely on votes.

8
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,460
With such strength, he only ended up working as a security guard

9
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,060
What a bad guy

10
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,270
From today on, you are the owner of the community.

11
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:28,270
Don't be nervous. I'm the security guard here.

12
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,070
People give me the nickname "Brother Yuan"

13
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,070
As long as you are obedient and pay property fees on time

14
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,070
I won't hurt you
